--- !ELF
FileHeader: { Class: [[CLASS=ELFCLASS64]], Data: ELFDATA2LSB, Type: ET_DYN, Machine: [[MACHINE=EM_X86_64]] }
Sections:
  ## Block 0: RET at 0, call-to-next at 1, RET at 8; other blocks end in RET.
  ## The call-to-next at 0x121 is also the last instruction in its function.
  - { Name: .text, Type: SHT_PROGBITS, Flags: [ SHF_ALLOC, SHF_EXECINSTR ],
      Address: 0, Offset: 0x1000, AddressAlign: 1,
      Content: "[[PREFIX=C3]]E8000000009090C3909090909090900F01D7909090909090909090909090C30F3790909090909090909090909090C30F079\
